            ARITHMETIC OPERATORS
                ====================

        They are used for performing mathematical calculation .


        In java we have exactly 5 aritmetic operators
        ==============================================
        1. + (Addition)
        2. - (Substraction)
        3. * (Multiplication)
        4. / (Divison)
        5. % (Modulo Divison or Mod)
             (Gives Remainder)


int a=10,b=3;

a+b-->13
a-b-->7
a*b-->30
a/b-->3    because int/int=int is always int
a%b-->1    


