Two more rules about / and %
==============================

1.in Divison if numerator is smaller than denominator answer is always 0.
ex: 5/10->0
    2/3->0

2. In Modulo if numerator is smaller than denominator answer always is numerator itself.
ex: 5%10->5
    2%3->2
